    {
      "source": "Based on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/file/Paths.html#get(java.net.URI)\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.file\"><code>Paths.get(URI)</code></a>'s resolution algorithm, checking\nregistered NIO file system providers, including the default file system\nfor \"file:...\" paths. Also supports Spring-style URL notation: any fully\nqualified standard URL and Spring's special \"classpath:\" pseudo-URL, as\nwell as Spring's context-specific relative file paths. As a fallback, a\npath will be resolved in the file system via <code>Paths#get(String)</code>\nif no existing context-relative resource could be found.",
      "translation": "基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/file/Paths.html#get(java.net.URI)\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.file\"><code>Paths.get(URI)</code></a>的解析算法，检查已注册的 NIO 文件系统提供者，包括\"file:...\"路径的默认文件系统。此外还支持 Spring 风格的 URL 表示法：任何完全限定的标准 URL、Spring 专用的\"classpath:\"伪 URL，以及 Spring 上下文特定的相对文件路径。作为后备方案，如果找不到现有的上下文相对资源，则通过<code>Paths#get(String)</code>在文件系统中解析该路径。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
